#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:7
msgid "OptimizationStrategy"
msgstr "OptimizationStrategy"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:9
msgid ""
"`saealib` delegates the selection of candidates sent for expensive true "
"evaluation to `OptimizationStrategy`. The Strategy describes candidate "
"generation, prediction, evaluation planning, Feedback, and Population "
"updates as one graph."
msgstr ""
"`saealib` は、高コストな真の評価へ送る候補の選択を `OptimizationStrategy` に委譲します。 "
"Strategyは、候補生成、予測、評価計画、Feedback、Population更新を一つのグラフとして記述します。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:12
msgid "OptimizationStrategy's role"
msgstr "OptimizationStrategyの役割"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:14
msgid ""
"The graph-native extension point is `build_graph(provider) -> "
"ComponentGraph`. Before execution, Optimizer passes this graph to the "
"Compiler to create an `ExecutablePlan`."
msgstr ""
"graph-native経路の拡張点は `build_graph(provider) -> ComponentGraph` です。 "
"Optimizerはこのグラフを実行前にCompilerへ渡し、`ExecutablePlan`を作成します。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:17
msgid ""
"`build_pipeline(provider) -> Pipeline` is the Stage compatibility path "
"and an optional compatibility representation for Strategies that use the "
"existing Pipeline DSL. Even in this form, a Stage inserted into a "
"structured Pipeline must be wrapped explicitly with "
"`stage_component(stage)`."
msgstr ""
"`build_pipeline(provider) -> Pipeline` はStage互換経路で、既存のPipeline "
"DSLを利用するStrategyが提供できる互換性用の記述形式です。 この形式を使う場合も、構造化Pipelineへ入れるStageは "
"`stage_component(stage)` で明示的に包みます。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:20
msgid ""
"`step(ctx, provider)` is the remaining boundary on the Stage "
"compatibility path. A new graph-native component reads a `StateView` and "
"returns a `StatePatch` or `NodeResult`."
msgstr ""
"`step(ctx, provider)` はStage互換経路に残る境界です。 新しいグラフネイティブコンポーネントは `StateView` "
"を読み、`StatePatch` または `NodeResult` を返します。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:23
msgid ""
"The class attribute `requires_surrogate: bool` indicates whether this "
"strategy needs a `SurrogateManager`. `Optimizer.validate()` checks this "
"attribute to confirm you aren't trying to use a strategy with "
"`requires_surrogate=True` while `surrogate_manager` is unset."
msgstr ""
"クラス属性`requires_surrogate: bool`は、この戦略が`SurrogateManager`を必要とするかを示します。 "
"`Optimizer.validate()`がこの属性を見て、`surrogate_manager`が未設定のまま`requires_surrogate=True`の戦略を使おうとしていないかを確認します。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:26
msgid "Built-in Strategies"
msgstr "組み込みStrategy"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "Approach"
msgstr "方式"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "`DirectStrategy`"
msgstr "`DirectStrategy`"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "Uses no surrogate; truly evaluates every generated candidate"
msgstr "サロゲートを使わず、生成した候補を全件真に評価する"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "`SteadyStateStrategy`"
msgstr "`SteadyStateStrategy`"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "Generates one candidate per step and supports asynchronous refill"
msgstr "1ステップにつき1候補を生成し、非同期補充に対応する"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "`IndividualBasedStrategy`"
msgstr "`IndividualBasedStrategy`"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "`evaluation_ratio: float = 0.1`"
msgstr "`evaluation_ratio: float = 0.1`"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid ""
"Scores every candidate with the surrogate, and truly evaluates only the "
"top `evaluation_ratio` fraction"
msgstr "全候補をサロゲートでスコアリングし、上位`evaluation_ratio`の割合だけ真に評価する"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "`PreSelectionStrategy`"
msgstr "`PreSelectionStrategy`"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "`n_candidates: int, n_select: int` (both required)"
msgstr "`n_candidates: int, n_select: int`（共に必須）"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid ""
"Generates `n_candidates`, scores them, and truly evaluates only the top "
"`n_select`"
msgstr "`n_candidates`件を生成してスコアリングし、上位`n_select`件だけ真に評価する"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "`GenerationBasedStrategy`"
msgstr "`GenerationBasedStrategy`"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "`gen_ctrl: int` (required)"
msgstr "`gen_ctrl: int`（必須）"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid ""
"Advances `gen_ctrl` generations using only the surrogate, then truly "
"evaluates a single generation"
msgstr "`gen_ctrl`世代分をサロゲートのみで進め、その後1世代だけ真に評価する"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:36
msgid ""
"`IndividualBasedStrategy` selects by fraction of individuals, while "
"`PreSelectionStrategy` selects by count of individuals. "
"`GenerationBasedStrategy` switches between surrogate and true evaluation "
"by generation, not by individual. `DirectStrategy` is the comparison "
"baseline that uses no surrogate at all, with `requires_surrogate=False`."
msgstr ""
"`IndividualBasedStrategy`は個体の割合、`PreSelectionStrategy`は個体の件数で選抜する点が異なります。"
" `GenerationBasedStrategy`は個体単位ではなく世代単位でサロゲートと真の評価を切り替えます。 "
"`DirectStrategy`はサロゲートを一切使わない比較対象で、`requires_surrogate=False`です。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:40
msgid ""
"For steady-state execution, combine `DirectStrategy` with an "
"`AsyncEvaluationScheduler`. The scheduler fills available worker slots, "
"polls without blocking, and commits each completed update in the "
"lifecycle order."
msgstr "定常状態実行では、`DirectStrategy`と`AsyncEvaluationScheduler`を組み合わせます。スケジューラは利用可能なワーカースロットを埋め、ブロックせずにポーリングし、完了した更新をライフサイクル順にコミットします。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:44
msgid "Each Strategy's pipeline structure"
msgstr "各Strategyのパイプライン構成"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "Pipeline"
msgstr "パイプライン"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid "CountGeneration → Ask → TrueEvaluation → ArchiveUpdate → Tell"
msgstr "世代数のカウント → 要求 → 真の評価 → アーカイブ更新 → 反映"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid ""
"CountGeneration → Ask → SurrogatePredictStage → AcquisitionStage → "
"SortByScore → TrueEvaluation (ratio-based) → ArchiveUpdate → Tell"
msgstr ""
"CountGeneration → Ask → SurrogatePredictStage → AcquisitionStage → "
"SortByScore → TrueEvaluation（比率指定）→ ArchiveUpdate → Tell"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid ""
"CountGeneration → Ask (n_candidates) → SurrogatePredictStage → "
"AcquisitionStage → TopKSelection(k=n_select) → TrueEvaluation → "
"ArchiveUpdate → Tell"
msgstr ""
"CountGeneration → Ask（n_candidates）→ SurrogatePredictStage → "
"AcquisitionStage → TopKSelection（k=n_select）→ TrueEvaluation → "
"ArchiveUpdate → Tell"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md
msgid ""
"SurrogateOnlyLoop (gen_ctrl times) → CountGeneration → Ask → "
"TrueEvaluation → ArchiveUpdate → Tell"
msgstr ""
"SurrogateOnlyLoop(gen_ctrl回) → CountGeneration → Ask → TrueEvaluation → "
"ArchiveUpdate → Tell"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:53
msgid ""
"Each Strategy's components include the `EvaluationPlan`, asynchronous "
"evaluation submission and collection, Feedback, and Tell. A Stage is a "
"compatibility execution unit for part of that work, not the same "
"execution contract as the entire structured Pipeline. See "
"[Stage](../observation_and_state/stage.md) and "
"[Framework](../../framework/index.md) for details."
msgstr "各Strategyの構成要素には、`EvaluationPlan`、非同期評価の送信と収集、Feedback、Tellが含まれます。Stageはその一部を担う互換性用の実行単位であり、構造化されたパイプライン全体と同じ実行契約ではありません。詳細は[Stage](../observation_and_state/stage.md)と[Framework](../../framework/index.md)を参照してください。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:57
msgid "Which Strategy to choose"
msgstr "どのStrategyを選ぶか"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:59
msgid ""
"For problems where evaluation cost is extremely high, "
"`IndividualBasedStrategy` or `PreSelectionStrategy`, which use the "
"surrogate to filter out most candidates, are effective. Early in the "
"search, when the surrogate's reliability is still low, or when you don't "
"want to pay the surrogate's own training cost frequently, "
"`GenerationBasedStrategy`, which advances multiple generations at once "
"using only the surrogate, is suited. For problems where the surrogate's "
"approximation error itself is unacceptable, or evaluation cost is "
"sufficiently low, relying solely on true evaluation via `DirectStrategy` "
"is reasonable."
msgstr ""
"評価コストが極めて高い問題では、サロゲートで大半の候補を足切りする`IndividualBasedStrategy`や`PreSelectionStrategy`が有効です。"
" "
"サロゲートの信頼度がまだ低い探索初期や、サロゲートの学習コスト自体を頻繁に払いたくない場合は、複数世代をまとめてサロゲートのみで進める`GenerationBasedStrategy`が適しています。"
" "
"サロゲートの近似誤差そのものが許容できない、あるいは評価コストが十分低い問題では、`DirectStrategy`で真の評価だけに頼るのが妥当です。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:63
msgid "Behavior of runtime swapping"
msgstr "実行時差し替えの挙動"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:65
msgid ""
"When you change configuration such as `provider.algorithm` or "
"`provider.surrogate_manager` at a step boundary in `iterate()` or "
"`run()`, the execution environment detects the change, recompiles the "
"plan, and applies it from the next generation. This procedure works on "
"both the Stage compatibility path and the graph-native path. When a "
"Component requests recompilation, the plan node returns `RuntimeCommand` "
"or `RequestRecompile` through `NodeResult.commands`. The request is "
"accepted when the Runtime environment provides `recompile()`, and "
"recompilation happens between steps. Rejection is also a normal result."
msgstr ""
"`iterate()` / `run()` のステップ境界で `provider.algorithm` や "
"`provider.surrogate_manager` "
"などの構成を変更すると、実行環境が変化を検出してplanを再コンパイルし、次世代から反映します。 この手順はStage互換経路とgraph-"
"native経路のどちらでも利用できます。 Component側から再コンパイルを要求するときは、plan nodeが "
"`NodeResult.commands` で `RuntimeCommand` / `RequestRecompile` を返します。 "
"要求はRuntime環境が `recompile()` "
"を提供する場合に受理され、再コンパイルはステップ間で行われます。受理されないことも正常な結果です。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:70
msgid "Implementing a custom Strategy"
msgstr "独自Strategyの実装方法"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:72
msgid ""
"When implementing a custom candidate-selection method, choose separately "
"between the graph-native path and the Stage compatibility path."
msgstr "独自の候補選択方式を実装するときは、graph-nativeの経路とStage互換の経路を分けて選びます。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:74
msgid ""
"**Graph-native path**: Implement `build_graph()` and return a "
"`ComponentGraph`. For a gradual migration using the Pipeline DSL, wrap "
"each Stage with `stage_component()` before passing it to "
"`lower_pipeline()`."
msgstr "**グラフネイティブ経路**：`build_graph()`を実装して`ComponentGraph`を返します。パイプラインDSLを使って段階的に移行する場合は、各Stageを`stage_component()`でラップしてから`lower_pipeline()`に渡します。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:98
msgid ""
"`first_stage` and `second_stage` stand for the Stage instances to "
"combine. This example shows only the boundary for building a "
"ComponentGraph from a Pipeline; add evaluation-plan and Feedback "
"contracts according to the Stage composition."
msgstr ""
"`first_stage` と `second_stage` は、実際に組み合わせるStageインスタンスを表します。 "
"この例はPipelineからComponentGraphを作る境界だけを示しており、評価計画やFeedbackの契約は各Stageの構成に応じて追加します。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md:101
msgid ""
"When adjusting only part of an existing Strategy, changing the "
"compatibility Pipeline with "
"[Pipeline.replace/find](../extension_guidelines.md) is preferable to "
"creating a new Strategy."
msgstr ""
"既存のStrategyの一部だけを調整する場合は、新しいStrategyを作るよりも "
"[Pipeline.replace/find](../extension_guidelines.md) "
"で互換性用パイプラインを変更する方が適しています。"

